  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) of the triangle formed by the latus rectum and the tangents at the end points of the latus rectum of <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4.05",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For the given hyperbola,&nbsp;<math><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0016_133cda872fb1.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.96667in;height:1.37361in\" /></p><p>From the figure,<br /><math><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Meeting point of tangents at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, the area of the triangle,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac> <mn>9</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac> <mn>9</mn> <mn>5</mn> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo><mn>4.05</mn></mrow> </math>&nbsp;sq. units</p>"
  }
